      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PREFER DIAMONDS (5) win record hardly excites but finds a much weaker contest today. Closed strongly two back when third to Proxima Dea over 1800m at Rosehill. Started a firm fav with a gritty third over 2000m at this course. Blinkers come off and should run well over the 1800m. ANDRON (4) got into all sorts of trouble last start from the awkward draw with a battling seventh over 1900m at Canterbury. Visors go on today from the rails draw and Dylan Gibbons sticks. Sharp improver. BINKOU (7) won well over this track and trip three back and hasn't been that far away in his two subsequent runs. Was three weeks between runs when he jumped in trip for a plugging second over 2000m here. Genuine each way contender. KIRKUK (6) unlucky not to salute three back over the 2000m at Kembla Grange when he held a forward position. Has dropped in trip at his last two outings and worth another look today.",
